{"ref":"BDB, מוֹרָד","hw":"מוֹרָד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרָד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>descent, slope</strong>; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מו׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:4\" href=\"/Micah.1.4\">Mi 1:4</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">Jos 10:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.5\">Je 48:5</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>descent, slope</em>, as designation of locality <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:5\" href=\"/Joshua.7.5\">Jos 7:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">10:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּמ׳ בֵּית־חוֹרֹן</span>; both JE); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּמ׳ חֹרוֹנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.5\">Je 48:5</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֹנַיִם בַּמּוֹרָד</span> ins. in <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.34\">2 S 13:34</a> 𝔊 We Dr; in gen. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמַיִם מֻגָּרִים בְּמוֹרָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:4\" href=\"/Micah.1.4\">Mi 1:4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲשֵׂה מוֹרָ֑ד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.29\">1 K 7:29</a> <em>work of descent</em>, i.e. <em>hanging-work</em> (VB).","next":"BDB, יַרְדֵּן","prev":"BDB, יֶ֫רֶד"}